Rule 3 (If the existing size is 1, the new size must be greater than or equal to 1.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if shape(v_1, i) = 1 then v_2[i] ≥ 1
