Rule 6 (The size of tensor cannot be decreased)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if shape(v_1, i) > 0 then v_2[i] ≥ shape(v_1, i)
