Rule 7 (If the input tensor has a dimension size of zero, the output tensor's corresponding dimension size must also be zero.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if shape(v_1, i) = 0 then v_2[i] = 0
